<h1>Main Site</h1>

<div style="margin: 2em 0; padding: 1em; background-color: #f5f5f5; border-left: 4px solid #333; font-style: italic;">
  <p style="margin: 0; line-height: 1.6;">
    Subdomains divide,<br>
